{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q22809053","formula":"C₁₅H₂₃NOS","hill":"C15H23NOS","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":23.0,"N":1.0,"O":1.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Esprocarb"},"descriptions":{"en":"Esprocarb is a thiocarbamate herbicide used preëmergently and post emergently to control annual weeds and grasses, such as on paddy rice. It was introduced in 1988 in Japan Esprocarb mixes have been tested in Japan starting in 1985 for its effectiveness against cockspur grass (Echinochloa crus-galli), often mixed with the herbicide bensulfuron-methyl. Testing for esprocarb was meant to allow for a longer, residual control of weeds, eliminating the need for follow-up one-shot herbicide applications."},"fame":3,"pubchemCid":91740,"mass":265.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCN(C(C)C(C)C)C(=O)SCC1=CC=CC=C1","inchikey":"BXEHUCNTIZGSOJ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"S-benzyl N-ethyl-N-(3-methylbutan-2-yl)carbamothioate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"91740","atoms":41,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.525,"y":-0.46,"z":0.323,"el":"S"},{"x":-1.13,"y":0.883,"z":-1.185,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.185,"y":-0.618,"z":0.245,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.531,"y":-0.327,"z":-0.193,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.923,"y":1.145,"z":0.077,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.703,"y":-0.727,"z":-1.657,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.374,"y":1.471,"z":-0.291,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.661,"y":1.531,"z":1.537,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.069,"y":-1.634,"z":1.301,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.058,"y":0.031,"z":-0.303,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.923,"y":-3.026,"z":0.709,"el":"C"},{"x":1.62,"y":0.604,"z":-0.642,"el":"C"},{"x":3.068,"y":0.388,"z":-0.301,"el":"C"},{"x":3.802,"y":-0.562,"z":-1.0,"el":"C"},{"x":3.654,"y":1.139,"z":0.709,"el":"C"},{"x":5.145,"y":-0.763,"z":-0.684,"el":"C"},{"x":4.998,"y":0.938,"z":1.025,"el":"C"},{"x":5.743,"y":-0.013,"z":0.329,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.224,"